<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
      color: #334155;
      background-color: #f8fafc;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }
    .container {
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 20px auto;
      background-color: #ffffff;
      border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
      border-radius: 12px;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
    }
    .header {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #b91c1c, #dc2626);
      color: #ffffff;
      padding: 30px 24px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .header h1 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 22px;
      font-weight: 700;
    }
    .content {
      padding: 30px 24px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    .claim-details {
      background-color: #fef2f2;
      border: 1px solid #fee2e2;
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 20px;
      margin: 24px 0;
    }
    .claim-details h3 {
      margin-top: 0;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      color: #991b1b;
      font-size: 16px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #fee2e2;
      padding-bottom: 8px;
    }
    .detail-row {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      font-size: 14px;
    }
    .detail-row:last-child {
      margin-bottom: 0;
    }
    .detail-label {
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #991b1b;
    }
    .detail-value {
      color: #450a0a;
    }
    .amount {
      font-size: 18px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #dc2626;
    }
    .warning-text {
      color: #b91c1c;
      font-weight: 600;
      background-color: #fef2f2;
      border-left: 4px solid #dc2626;
      padding: 12px;
      margin: 20px 0;
      font-size: 14px;
      border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;
    }
    .footer {
      background-color: #f8fafc;
      padding: 20px;
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #94a3b8;
      border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <h1>FINAL NOTICE: Outstanding Detention Payment</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="content">
      <p>Dear <%= brokerName || 'Broker / Billing Department' %>,</p>
      
      <p>This is the <strong>FINAL NOTICE</strong> regarding the unpaid detention amount for the load detailed below. Despite multiple previous reminders, the invoice remains unpaid and is now severely past due.</p>
      
      <div class="warning-text">
        <strong>ACTION REQUIRED IMMEDIATELY:</strong> If payment is not received or resolved within 48 hours, we will be forced to escalate this matter to legal counsel and refer the account to collections.
      </div>
      
      <div class="claim-details">
        <h3>Overdue Claim Information</h3>
        <div class="detail-row">
          <span class="detail-label">Driver Name:</span>
          <span class="detail-value"><%= driverName %></span>
        </div>
        <div class="detail-row">
          <span class="detail-label">Facility Name:</span>
          <span class="detail-value"><%= facilityName %></span>
        </div>
        <% if (loadNumber) { %>
        <div class="detail-row">
          <span class="detail-label">Load Number:</span>
          <span class="detail-value"><%= loadNumber %></span>
        </div>
        <% } %>
        <% if (bolNumber) { %>
        <div class="detail-row">
          <span class="detail-label">BOL Number:</span>
          <span class="detail-value"><%= bolNumber %></span>
        </div>
        <% } %>
        <div class="detail-row" style="margin-top: 16px; padding-top: 12px; border-top: 1px dashed #fca5a5;">
          <span class="detail-label" style="font-size: 16px;">Total Overdue Amount:</span>
          <span class="amount">$<%= Number(amount).toFixed(2) %></span>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <p>Please send immediate payment confirmation or check numbers to settle this debt. Reply to this email immediately to prevent legal referral.</p>
      
      <p>We await your prompt response.</p>
      
      <p style="margin-top: 30px;">Sincerely,<br><strong style="color: #b91c1c;"><%= driverName %></strong></p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
      <p>Sent automatically via Luke Thompson System on behalf of <%= driverName %>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
